          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11334' id='344' type-v2='text' w='89993' x='500' y='17583'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>This is a self service dashboard that enables users to compare Team concurrency with different metrics. Multiple teams can be selected but meaningful insights can be gained only when comparable teams are grouped together.

</run>
              <run bold='true' underline='true'>USAGE GUIDE : </run>
              <run>
1/ Select a team or combination of teams with the &apos;Team&apos; filter
2/ Select a bin size for team concurrency with the  &apos;Choose your Bin Size&apos; filter. Data will be grouped wrt. the concurrency bin size of your choice
3/ Select the 2 metrics you would like to compare with the &apos;Choose your 1st Metric&apos; and &apos;Choose your 2nd Metric&apos; filters
4/ With the &apos;Served Chats Threshold&apos; you can adjust the count of served chats you want to consider. This can be relevant when multiple teams are being grouped. Enter a value in the box and press Enter

</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4416' id='397' is-fixed='true' type-v2='layout-basic' w='99000' x='500' y='28917'>
